    "limits": "Planning only: no product source, doctrine, package changeset, staging or publication. Prototypes transform own source in Bun memory and do not compile proposed public types or prove React/native/browser delivery, authored inheritance, schema reconfiguration, arbitrary spans, range admission or structural reuse. Baseline and prototype ran in separate processes with within-process controls; no p95 or production speedup claim. Root scale probe uses one API/read feature; real owned-root feature probe uses List/Table/Figure, two numbered items and a 1x1 table. Text payload size excludes serialized root structure. Production adoption and real-kit frozen-budget reruns are S1-S5 gates. Affected docs/probes are excluded by Ultracite: scoped lint:fix returned no files (exit 2), recorded N/A rather than green. Plan completion, source/receipt checker, reference/whitespace and ledger gates establish design closure only."
